Help For The Power

Power: enter whole watts, then Enter. h then Enter reads this help and returns to the field. Blank Enter or q then Enter cancels and returns to Settings. YAC converts watts to an estimated relative percentage on Icom, using the model and band rating. On the IC-705, 3 watts is approximately 30 percent of its 10-watt scale; battery operation limits entry to 5 watts. This is an estimate, not measured output. Supply, mode, radio limits and regional models can affect actual power. Successful changes repeat the entered value, for example 33W Set, after write and readback. This confirms the requested setting, not measured output watts. q leaves Settings; v reports the radio setting: percentage for Icom, watts for Yaesu/Kenwood.

